msgstr "ປ່ຽນສື່"

#. %1 is the current cd number
#: src/include/instserver/dialogs.rb:233
#, ycp-format
msgid "Insert CD %1 then press continue."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາໃສ່ແຜ່ນ CD %1 ແລ້ວກົດສືບຕໍ່."

