msgstr "ກະລຸນາເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ISO %1 ແລ້ວກົດສືບຕໍ່."

#. %2 is the product name and version
#: src/include/instserver/dialogs.rb:244
#, ycp-format
msgid "Insert CD %1 of %2."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາໃສ່ແຜ່ນ CD %1 ຂອງ %2."

#: src/include/instserver/dialogs.rb:245
#, ycp-format
msgid "Select ISO image %1 of %2."
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ISO %1 ຂອງ %2."

#. popup request, %1 is CD medium name
#: src/include/instserver/dialogs.rb:284
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"Insert\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາໃສ່\n"
"%1"

#. popup request, %1 is ISO name
#: src/include/instserver/dialogs.rb:313
#, ycp-format
msgid "Select %1"
msgstr "ເລືອກ %1"

#. add-on medium (e.g. service pack) doesn't match configured repository
#: src/include/instserver/dialogs.rb:553
#, ycp-format
msgid ""
"The medium requires product %1, which is not provided\n"
"by the current repository.\n"
"\n"
"Select the base product medium first."
msgstr ""
"ສື່ນີ້ຕ້ອງການຜະລິດຕະພັນ %1, ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ມີໃຫ້\n"
"ໃນຄັງເກັບປັດຈຸບັນ.\n"
"\n"
"ກະລຸນາເລືອກສື່ຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນຫຼັກກ່ອນ."

#. else, we create CD1, CD2, etc. (for code10 always)
#: src/include/instserver/dialogs.rb:671
msgid "Copying CD contents to local directory"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຄັດລອກເນື້ອໃນ CD ໄປຍັງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ"

#: src/include/instserver/dialogs.rb:672
msgid "This may take a while..."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາຄາວໜຶ່ງ..."

