msgid ""
"Contents already exist in this directory.\n"
"Not copying CDs."
msgstr ""
"ມີເນື້ອໃນຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ແລ້ວ.\n"
"ຈະບໍ່ຄັດລອກ CD."

#. for translators: popup question (prefer more shorter lines than few long lines)
