msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂະນະສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTPD."

#. All helps are here
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:16
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Network Server Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີເຄືອຂ່າຍ</big></b><br>\n"
"</p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:19
msgid ""
"<p>Select one of the server options and specify where all the repositories\n"
"should be hosted on the local system.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກເຊີເວີອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ ແລະ ລະບຸບ່ອນທີ່ຄັງເກັບທັງໝົດ\n"
"ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນລະບົບພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ.\n"
"</p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:24
msgid ""
"<p>If you have one of the services already running and want to do the\n"
"server configuration manually, select not to configure \n"
"the services.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຖ້າທ່ານມີບໍລິການໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການ\n"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກບໍ່ຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ\n"
"ບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:30
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>NFS Server Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ NFS</big></b><br>\n"
"</p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:33
msgid ""
"<p>To complete this configuration, a new entry in the file\n"
"<em>/etc/exports</em> must be added and the NFS server must be \n"
"installed and started.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສົມບູນ, ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມລາຍການໃໝ່ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌\n"
"<em>/etc/exports</em> ແລະ ເຊີເວີ NFS ຕ້ອງຖືກ\n"
"ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:39
msgid ""
"<p>If you need to restrict access to the exported directories to certain \n"
"hosts, add a more restrictive wild card mask. For example, use "
"<em>192.168.1.0/24</em>\n"
"to restrict access to the <em>192.168.1.0</em> subnet.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ສົ່ງອອກໃຫ້ສະເພາະບາງ\n"
"ໂຮສຕ໌, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມມາດສ໌ (Wild Card) ທີ່ຈຳກັດກວ່າເກົ່າ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ໃຊ້ <em>192.168.1.0/24</em>\n"
"ເພື່ອຈຳກັດການເຂົ້າເຖິງສະເພາະເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍ <em>192.168.1.0</em>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:45
msgid ""
"<p>Additionally, set the export options. For more details about the "
"available\n"
"options, see the manual page for <em>exports</em> (man exports(5))\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງອອກ. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ\n"
"ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີໃຫ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ຈາກໜ້າຄູ່ມືຂອງ <em>exports</em> (man exports(5))\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:50
msgid ""
"<p>The repository will be available at the following URL:\n"
"<tt>nfs://Host_IP/Repository_Name</tt></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຄັງເກັບຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ URL ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"<tt>nfs://Host_IP/Repository_Name</tt></p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:53
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>FTP Server Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ FTP</big></b><br>\n"
"</p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:56
msgid ""
"<p>To complete this configuration, an FTP server must be \n"
"installed and started.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສົມບູນ, ເຊີເວີ FTP ຕ້ອງຖືກ\n"
"ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:59
msgid ""
"<p>If the chosen software repository directory is outside\n"
"the FTP server hierarchy, a mount entry is added to <tt>/etc/fstab</tt>.\n"
"This makes the software repository directory available under the\n"
"FTP server (using the <tt>--bind</tt> option of <tt>mount</tt>).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຖ້າໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຄັງເກັບຊອບແວທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ຢູ່ພາຍນອກ\n"
"ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງເຊີເວີ FTP, ລາຍການການເມົາທ໌ (mount) ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ <tt>/etc/fstab</tt>.\n"
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຄັງເກັບຊອບແວສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ພາຍໃຕ້\n"
"ເຊີເວີ FTP (ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກ <tt>--bind</tt> ຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ <tt>mount</tt>).\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:66
msgid ""
"<p>The installation server will be available to clients using the following "
"URL:\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເຊີເວີຕິດຕັ້ງຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ສຳລັບເຄື່ອງລູກຂ່າຍຜ່ານ URL ດັ່ງນີ້:\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:69
msgid ""
"<p><tt>ftp://&lt;Host IP&gt;/&lt;Repository Name&gt;</tt>\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><tt>ftp://&lt;Host IP&gt;/&lt;Repository Name&gt;</tt>\n"
"</p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:70
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>HTTP Server Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີ HTTP</big></b><br>\n"
"</p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:73
msgid ""
"<p>To complete this configuration, an HTTP server must be \n"
"installed and started. The alias will be used to reference the installation\n"
"server root directory.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສົມບູນ, ເຊີເວີ HTTP ຕ້ອງຖືກ\n"
"ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເລີ່ມເຮັດວຽກ. ຊື່ແຝງ (Alias) ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອອ້າງອີງເຖິງ\n"
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຫຼັກຂອງເຊີເວີຕິດຕັ້ງ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:78
msgid ""
"<p>Select a short and easy to remember alias. For example, if you select\n"
"<em>SUSE</em> as the alias, the repositories will be available as shown "
"below:</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກຊື່ແຝງທີ່ສັ້ນ ແລະ ຈື່ໄດ້ງ່າຍ. ຕົວຢ່າງ, ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກ\n"
"<em>SUSE</em> ເປັນຊື່ແຝງ, ຄັງເກັບຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງລຸ່ມນີ້:</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:81
msgid ""
"<p><tt>http://&lt;Host IP&gt;/SUSE/&lt;Repository Name&gt;</tt>\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><tt>http://&lt;Host IP&gt;/SUSE/&lt;Repository Name&gt;</tt>\n"
"</p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:84 src/include/instserver/helps.rb:94
msgid ""
"<p><b>Configuration of the Repository</b><br>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບ</b><br>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:85
msgid ""
"<p>The repository name is used to create a directory under which all "
"product\n"
"CDs are copied and managed. The repository is accessed using the\n"
"configured protocol (NFS, FTP, or HTTP).</p> \n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຊື່ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອສ້າງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ ເຊິ່ງແຜ່ນ CD ຜະລິດຕະພັນທັງໝົດ\n"
"ຈະຖືກຄັດລອກ ແລະ ຈັດການຢູ່ທີ່ນັ້ນ. ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກເຂົ້າເຖິງໂດຍໃຊ້\n"
"ໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ (NFS, FTP, ຫຼື HTTP).</p> \n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:90
msgid "<p><b><big>SLP Support</big></b></p>"
msgstr "<p><b><big>ຮອງຮັບ SLP</big></b></p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:91
msgid ""
"<p>SLP (Service Location Protocol) facilitates finding an installation "
"server. \n"
"If checked, the repository will be announced on the network using SLP.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>SLP (Service Location Protocol) ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຄົ້ນຫາເຊີເວີຕິດຕັ້ງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. \n"
"ຖ້າເລືອກໄວ້, ຄັງເກັບຈະຖືກປະກາດໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍໂດຍໃຊ້ SLP.</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:95
msgid ""
"<p>Select a source drive from the list, insert the first medium of a base "
"product, and press\n"
"<b>Next</b> to copy the content into the local repository.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກໄດຣຟ໌ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຈາກລາຍການ, ໃສ່ສື່ແຜ່ນທຳອິດຂອງຜະລິດຕະພັນຫຼັກ, ແລ້ວກົດ\n"
"<b>ຖັດໄປ</b> ເພື່ອຄັດລອກເນື້ອໃນລົງໃນຄັງເກັບພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ.</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:98
msgid ""
"<p>When the base media are copied to the local repository, you can add "
"additional\n"
"CDs to the repository (for example, Service Pack CDs or any add-on CDs).</"
"p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເມື່ອສື່ຫຼັກຖືກຄັດລອກລົງໃນຄັງເກັບແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແຜ່ນ\n"
"CD ເສີມໃສ່ຄັງເກັບໄດ້ (ຕົວຢ່າງ, CD ເຊີວິດແພັກ ຫຼື CD ເສີມອື່ນໆ).</p>\n"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:101
msgid "<p><b><big>ISO Images</big></b></p>"
msgstr "<p><b><big>ໄຟລ໌ ISO</big></b></p>"

#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:102
msgid ""
"<p>ISO images can be used instead of CD or DVD media. If you press <b>Next</"
"b>, you can\n"
"select ISO image files.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ໄຟລ໌ ISO ສາມາດໃຊ້ແທນສື່ CD ຫຼື DVD ໄດ້. ຖ້າທ່ານກົດ <b>ຖັດໄປ</b>, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດ\n"
"ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ISO ໄດ້.</p>\n"

#. Read dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:106
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Initializing Configuration</big></b><br>\n"
"Please wait...<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</big></b><br>\n"
"ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ...<br></p>\n"

#. Read dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:110
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Initialization:</big></b><br>\n"
"Safely abort the configuration utility by pressing <b>Abort</b> now.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຍົກເລີກການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍການກົດ <b>ຍົກເລີກ</b> ດຽວນີ້.</p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 1/2
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:114
msgid ""
"<p><b>Saving Repository Configuration</b><br>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ກຳລັງບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບ</b><br>\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Write dialog help 2/2
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:118
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Aborting Saving:</big></b><br>\n"
"Abort the save procedure by pressing <b>Abort</b>.\n"
"An additional dialog informs whether it is safe to do so.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການຍົກເລີກການບັນທຶກ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຍົກເລີກຂັ້ນຕອນການບັນທຶກໂດຍການກົດ <b>ຍົກເລີກ</b>.\n"
"ຈະມີກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມແຈ້ງເຕືອນວ່າການຍົກເລີກນັ້ນປອດໄພຫຼືບໍ່.\n"
"</p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:125
msgid ""
"<p><b>Repository Configuration</b><br>\n"
"Configure the installation server here.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບ</b><br>\n"
"ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ນີ້.<br></p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:129
msgid ""
"<p><b>Adding a Repository:</b><br>\n"
"Unconfigured directories are detected in the repository directory and then "
"made \n"
"available for configuration.\n"
"To add a repository, select it from the list of unconfigured repositories "
"and press <b>Configure</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ການເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບ:</b><br>\n"
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະຖືກກວດພົບໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຄັງເກັບ ແລະ ຈະຖືກ\n"
"ສະແດງໃຫ້ເລືອກເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າ.\n"
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກຈາກລາຍການຄັງເກັບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລ້ວກົດ <b>ຕັ້ງຄ່າ</b>.</p>\n"

#. Summary dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:136
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting:</big></b><br>\n"
"If you press <b>Edit</b>, an additional dialog in which to change\n"
"the configuration opens.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ລຶບ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ຖ້າທ່ານກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ</b>, ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສຳລັບປ່ຽນແປງ\n"
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນ.</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 1/3
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:142
msgid ""
"<p><b>Repositories Overview</b><br>\n"
"Get an overview of the configured repositories and edit their \n"
"configuration if necessary.<br></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ພາບລວມຄັງເກັບ</b><br>\n"
"ເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງຄັງເກັບທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ ແລະ ແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າ\n"
"ຖ້າຈຳເປັນ.<br></p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 2/3
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:148
msgid ""
"<p><b>Adding a Repository:</b><br>\n"
"Press <b>Add</b> to configure a repository.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ການເພີ່ມຄັງເກັບ:</b><br>\n"
"ກົດ <b>ເພີ່ມ</b> ເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າຄັງເກັບ.</p>\n"

#. Ovreview dialog help 3/3
#: src/include/instserver/helps.rb:152
msgid ""
"<p><b><big>Editing or Deleting:</big></b><br>\n"
"Choose the repository you want to change or remove and\n"
"press  <b>Edit</b> or <b>Delete</b>, respectively.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><big>ການແກ້ໄຂ ຫຼື ລຶບ:</big></b><br>\n"
"ເລືອກຄັງເກັບທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແປງ ຫຼື ລຶບອອກ ແລະ\n"
"ກົດ <b>ແກ້ໄຂ</b> ຫຼື <b>ລຶບ</b> ຕາມລຳດັບ.</p>\n"

#. Read service data using _auto
#: src/modules/Instserver.rb:316
msgid ""
"The FTP installation server requires an FTP server package. The vsftpd "
"package\n"
"will now be installed.\n"
msgstr ""
"ເຊີເວີຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ FTP ຕ້ອງການຊຸດໂປຣແກຣມ FTP ເຊີເວີ. ຊຸດໂປຣແກຣມ vsftpd\n"
"ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງດຽວນີ້.\n"

#. Write Apache config
#. @param enable [Boolean] state : Yes/No
#. @return [void]
#: src/modules/Instserver.rb:410
msgid "Unable to write /etc/sysconfig/apache2"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນ /etc/sysconfig/apache2"

#: src/modules/Instserver.rb:418
msgid ""
"The HTTP installation server requires an HTTP server package. The apache2 "
"package\n"
"will now be installed."
msgstr ""
"ເຊີເວີຕິດຕັ້ງແບບ HTTP ຕ້ອງການຊຸດໂປຣແກຣມ HTTP ເຊີເວີ. ຊຸດໂປຣແກຣມ apache2\n"
"ຈະຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງດຽວນີ້."

#. Setup NFS Server
#. @param dir [String] directory
#. @param options [String]
#. @return [Boolean]
#: src/modules/Instserver.rb:529
msgid ""
"Directory is already exported via NFS.\n"
"Leave NFS exports unmodified?\n"
msgstr ""
"ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຖືກສົ່ງອອກຜ່ານ NFS ແລ້ວ.\n"
"ຕ້ອງການປະການສົ່ງອອກ NFS ໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າບໍ?\n"

#. Instserver read dialog caption
#: src/modules/Instserver.rb:1073
msgid "Initializing Configuration"
msgstr "ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. Progress stage 1/2
#: src/modules/Instserver.rb:1083
msgid "Read configuration file"
msgstr "ອ່ານໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. Progress stage 2/2
#: src/modules/Instserver.rb:1085
msgid "Search for a new repository"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາຄັງເກັບໃໝ່"

#. Progress step 1/2
